Top-down dungeon map, dark fantasy style, ink and parchment aesthetic. Underground prison level, torchlit. Five rooms connected by corridors. Room 1 (top): guard room with a wooden table, stools, playing cards scattered, tankards, three swords on wall rack. Room 2: long corridor with four barred cells on each side, straw on floors, one cell has a huge muscular man inside. Room 3: armory/storage with weapon racks (mostly empty, rusty halberds), wooden crates, coiled rope. Room 4: small room with a circular well opening in the floor, a wooden pulley system with rope and basket, heavy iron door on the south wall. Stone walls, torch sconces, puddles. Grid overlay 5ft squares. No text, no labels. Warm torchlight palette with deep shadows in cells.
